        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "World Wildlife Day falls on March 3 every year. It is a global celebration of all the wonderful wild animals and plants on the planet. What can we do to make the world a better place for them? Check out the tips below!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l1",
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Learn more about the wildlife in your area. You can visit your local wildlife "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "rescue",
              "ref": "v-rescue"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " centre and "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "botanical garden",
              "ref": "v-botanical-garden"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ". Reading books about wildlife is also a good choice."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "If you find a wild animal or plant somewhere, don’t take it home. You can take a picture of it instead. Wild animals and plants need to stay in their home environment to survive."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Don’t feed wild animals human food. Some animals can get sick from eating human food. Others may become "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "dependent",
              "ref": "v-dependent"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " on your food and forget how to "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "forage"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " on their own."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Don’t throw food waste or other trash on the road. Wild animals may be attracted to dangerous roads by the trash."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "If you find an "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "injured",
              "ref": "v-injured"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " wild animal, call your local wildlife rescue centre. The staff there will help "
            },
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "care for",
              "ref": "v-care-for"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " the animals."
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
